---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Home">
  <section class="min-h-[85vh] flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-20 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <span class="inline-block uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-xs text-white/70 border border-white/25 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-8">
        Web Design &amp; Development
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl leading-tight mb-8">
        Affordable, Professional<br class="hidden md:block" /> Websites for Dublin Businesses
      </h1>
      <div class="mx-auto my-8 h-px w-16 bg-white/50"></div>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white/85 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
        I build completely customised websites for tradespeople, local businesses and small brands across Dublin, without the agency price tag. No templates, no bloated packages, just a site designed properly around your business.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-white text-brand-500 px-7 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-white/90 transition font-medium">
          Get a Free Quote
        </a>
        <a href="/services" class="border border-white/60 px-7 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition font-medium">
          View Pricing
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="border-t border-white/15">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 py-20 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl border border-white/25 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center bg-white/5">
        <img src="/images/studio1.jpeg" alt="Website design mockups on a laptop screen" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-sm text-white/60 mb-4">Why Harbour Web Studio</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl mb-5">Genuinely custom, not just a website</h2>
        <p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Plenty of people can build you a website. The real difference is a site designed properly
          around your business, your customers and your goals, built by hand rather than bolted
          together from a template.
        </p>
        <p class="text-white/85 leading-relaxed">
          Whether you need a simple one-page site or something more sophisticated with bookings
          and online payments, everything is built around what actually fits your business.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white text-brand-500">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl text-center mb-14">Who I Work With</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="border border-brand-500/40 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
          <h3 class="text-xl mb-2 font-semibold text-brand-500">Tradespeople</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-500 text-sm">Plumbers, electricians, builders and landscapers who want to look as good online as their work does in person.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-brand-500/40 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
          <h3 class="text-xl mb-2 font-semibold text-brand-500">Local Services</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-500 text-sm">Barbers, beauticians, personal trainers and driving instructors who need bookings, not just a brochure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="border border-brand-500/40 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
          <h3 class="text-xl mb-2 font-semibold text-brand-500">Small Businesses</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-500 text-sm">Cafes, consultants, photographers and mechanics who deserve a proper website without agency prices.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
